# Build context for submission/Dockerfile, which is built from this repository root.
#
# Deny-all then re-include, rather than listing exclusions: the repo root also holds
# data-preprocessing/, docs/, logs/, mr_challenge_template/ and ~105 MB of NVIDIA assets/figures,
# none of which belong in a submission image. An allowlist means adding a directory to the repo
# cannot silently grow the image.
*

!NV-Generate-CTMR/scripts/
!NV-Generate-CTMR/configs/
!NV-Generate-CTMR/LICENSE
!NV-Generate-CTMR/LICENSE.weights
!contrastive-pretraining/mrrate_r2v/
!submission/predict.py
!submission/routing.py
!submission/entrypoint.sh

# Re-excluded inside the allowlisted trees.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/*.ipynb
